    "body": "## Scope\n\nSynthetic-only executable SQLite feasibility probe for the proposed Chat03B2 recovery/idempotency table states. This is not a deployable migration and does not authorize private-alpha policy, hosted D1, Worker auth, or deployment.\n\nAdds only:\n- `gameplay-server/test/fixtures/chat03b2_schema_v4_probe.sql`\n- `gameplay-server/test/test_chat03b2_schema_v4_probe.py`\n\nThe fixture applies actual migrations 0001-0003 in a temporary SQLite database, then seeds synthetic battles, capabilities, creation rows, receipts, and outbox rows. It checks RECOVERABLE/CLOSED/TOMBSTONE copying, original capability digest/generation matching, first-commit/rotation/revocation/scheduler closure, tombstone cleanup and retention, FK ordering, rollback, receipt uniqueness, and two-connection CAS/revocation races.\n\n## Local evidence\n\n- Python unittest discovery: 39/39 PASS (new probe 17/17).\n- Probe direct run: 44 positive and 18 negative assertion scenarios PASS.\n- `tools/validate-orchestration-policy.py`: PASS_REPOSITORY_POLICY.\n- `git diff --cached --check`: PASS before commit.\n\nImportant limitation: migration 0002 has no stored capability generation. The probe assigns generation 1 only as synthetic fixture input and explicitly does not establish a generation-aware existing Worker contract. SQLite evidence does not prove Cloudflare D1 semantics, AES-GCM correctness, hosted D1, authenticated Worker behavior, or deployment readiness.",
    "changed_files": 2,
